Hi all,

Strategic Accounts is RED this week. 8 of 16 releases in SIT are blocked, mai=
nly the FAB (Magnati) CRs on hold for GITEX and ADCB releases waiting on VDI =
access. FAB's UAEDDS and Payout release is also showing very high defect dens=
ity and the only UAT leakage in the tower.

This week: 16 releases in SIT (7 Implementation, 9 CR) | 8 blocked | unit tes=
t results shared on 31% | automation on 50%

Support needed from you
1. FAB (Magnati): please secure a dedicated SIT cycle, additional VDIs and BA=
 support. Three CRs are on hold for GITEX, and UAEDDS and Payout has a SIT de=
fect density of 19.83 and 32% UAT leakage.
2. ADCB: please escalate VDI access and API sync with the bank. SIT on both A=
