arted.
3. K-NET and OAB: please escalate the bank dependencies: the K-NET Payment Or=
chestrator payload, and Samsung/Apple Pay sandbox accounts for OAB Amex 3DS2.

Dates at risk
- 27 Nov =E2=80=93 FAB UAEDDS and Payout, Benefit 8-digit BIN, OAB Click to P=
ay Ph-2: SIT ETAs at risk; all three run SIT and UAT in parallel.
- 30 Nov =E2=80=93 ADCB Jawyan Touch Point Prepaid and QNB Alahli Phase 1.3: =
waiting on bank sample files and dev fixes.
- 31 Dec =E2=80=93 DU Telecom Phase-2: 22 user stories blocked by MPGS connec=
